\begin_layout Standard
We end this methods section with a case study investigating the limits of
 STEM imaging arising from the FIB specimen preparation procedure for TEM.
 Over the course of the project the FIB lamella preparation procedure was
 optimised for beam sensitive materials.
 This has resulted in a sharp improvement of lamella quality, which is demonstra
ted here by STEM analysis.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
